# Facilitator instructions

- Create new exercise folder & populate with template file.
- Fill in the missing information which is relevant for the exercise.
- Create a scenario where you (the facilitator) know the whole truth of what has happened, but the attendees can only see the surface. Think of it either as role playing or as a general discussion to have among the participants.

## Calendar invite
- Attach this document to the calendar invite.
- Make sure all relevant personnel are invited.

## Do the exercise
- Record the meeting.
- Take small notes during the exercise, but make sure to do the exercise properly.
- Document the findings together with the attendees.
- Create action tickets.
- Have a discussion about the exercise in itself.
- Document the findings.

## After
- Paste the meeting notes.
- Follow up with the decided action tickets.
- Once done, update this document with the status.
